The world's cars, made in this repository by tools/world/cars/ from no third-party asset.

Every body is lofted by tools/world/cars/cars.py from the profiles in it (its top line, beltline,
widths and underside), its glass, lamps, grille, plates and seams laid on it from the outlines in it,
its wheels built from numbers in it; Blender ran the script (only as a tool: its GPL-3.0 does not
reach what it makes) and tools/world/cars/cars.mjs (gltf-transform, MIT) packed it. No photograph,
scan, model or texture went in, and none of the cars is any maker's design. The file is part of this
project and under its licence: MIT, the LICENSE at the repository's root.

File       What it holds
cars.glb   four cars, a sedan, a hatchback, an SUV and a van, each near (body, glass, trim, lamps)
           and far (the body with its glass and trim in it, and the lamps), painted by the page

Remade with:
  blender --background --factory-startup --python tools/world/cars/cars.py -- <build-dir>
  node tools/world/cars/cars.mjs <build-dir>/raw agentdata/fleet/static/world/cars
